  "claim_boundary": "This record selects only the allocation-free prompt-wide Embedding gather and full-Attention preprocessing mechanisms on the exact Legacy-C512, SM87WeightOnly, non-sealed-arithmetic development route. Real-model P514, P4096 plus 15 Decode transitions, and P8192 comparisons establish bit-identical committed convolution/GDN state, all used K/V cache rows in all 16 full-Attention layers, generation transcript, public logits statistics, generated token IDs, and text for each selected mechanism alone and together. Matched BCCB runs at 4096, 8192, 16384, and 32768 controlled token-ID prompts are positive at every length, but use only two samples per route and therefore support the absorption decision without statistical, release, or production qualification. The 32K run uses an explicit 8 GiB request-arena and expanded per-run capacity; the evaluation adapter's default capacity remains 8192. The short EvalScope run proves integration health only. This one-time owner-directed absorption closeout does not resume paused P3 optimization, qualify the final product API, or alter the Constitution targets.",
